  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;| &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terraforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraForged</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/supermassimo/DynamicTrees-ExC/blob/1.12.2/banner.png?raw=true\" width=\"588\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oeSBh9T.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;<strong>简介</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;本模组旨在为动态树与 TerraForged 之间添加兼容性。虽然你可能已经注意到，由于 TerraForged 修改了原版生物群系，部分动态树已在 TerraForged 世界中生成，但 TerraForged 也添加了其独有的生物群系——本模组将为此类生物群系添加动态树。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;<strong>特性</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/e/e9/Oak_Log_(UD)_JE5_BE3.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">世界生成</span></strong><br>所有 TerraForged 生物群系的普通树木生成已被取消，并替换为动态树。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/360/707/cactus.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;DT+</span><br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictreesplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees +</a> 为可选依赖项。安装后，TerraForged 生物群系中的仙人掌将被 DT+ 中的仙人掌物种替换。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SRb8VX6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">依赖项</span></strong><br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a>&nbsp;[0.10.0-Beta13+]<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terraforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraForged</a>&nbsp;[0.2.10+]<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>&nbsp;[36.1.0+]</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>授权与整合包</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;特此授权在任何整合包或服务器中使用本模组。既然我已明确告知你可以使用，请勿再次询问是否允许在你的整合包中打包本模组，这很令人困扰。所有源代码均可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesTerraForged\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上查看，该项目采用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesTerraForged/blob/1.16.5/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 许可证</a>。</p>",
